+ * Generated with linux-mdss-dsi-panel-driver-generator from the vendor device
+ * tree (MiCode/Xiaomi_Kernel_OpenSource, branch vayu-r-oss), then merged into
+ * a single driver since both variants only differ in their init sequence.
